## Scientific And Domain Assessments

### Original source condition survives composition

scope: concern. Targets: PHOSPHATE758-ADMISSION.

The selected two partial owners do not satisfy the explicit three-owner/six-override/membership coupling.

### Genuine W07 source residual and all case preservation

provenance: supported. Targets: PHOSPHATE758-ADMISSION.

W07 originalb58c remains separable; native655 is equal-object serialization. Conditional deferral retains all cases and does not rewrite original source decisions.

## Findings

### PHOSPHATE758-ADMISSION-001: Blocked staged fragments were selected without their coupled operation

major / open / confirmed; issue key: MIM-phosphate758-staged-fragment-admission.

Preserve original blocked proposals but defer both W08 contributions. Old union cannot be installed unchanged or its review silently transferred to the residual.

## Recommended Actions And Acceptance Checks

### ACT-DEFER

After filed1237 root selection, retain source cases and only separately reviewed W07 residual; update native origin/review/case joins without fabricating retirement.

